{"ref":"BDB, עָקָר","hw":"עָקָר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עָקָר</span></big>  <strong>adj. barren</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> of male <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.14\">Dt 7:14</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲקָרָה</span> of female v <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.14\">14</a> (mankind and beasts), <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:26\" href=\"/Exodus.23.26\">Ex 23:26</a> (E; female); elsewhere of women <a data-ref=\"Genesis 11:30\" href=\"/Genesis.11.30\">Gn 11:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:21\" href=\"/Genesis.25.21\">25:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 29:31\" href=\"/Genesis.29.31\">29:31</a> (all J), <a data-ref=\"Judges 13:2\" href=\"/Judges.13.2\">Ju 13:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 13:3\" href=\"/Judges.13.3\">3</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.5\">1 S 2:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 24:21\" href=\"/Job.24.21\">Jb 24:21</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 113:9\" href=\"/Psalms.113.9\">ψ 113:9</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">עֲקֶרֶת</span> cstr.); of personif. Zion <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 54:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.54.1\">Is 54:1</a>.","next":"BDB, עֵ֫קֶר²","prev":"BDB, עִקֵּר"}